        "date": "2026-11-22T16:47:04Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(post): route mach3 header notes through onComment and count 21 posts\n\nMain's PR #3087 (issue #2996) routes post header notes through the JS\nonComment hook, and every shipped post overrides it. The merge refresh of\nthis PR with main failed the comment_escape header-notes test because the\nnew mach3.cps had no override, so raw English text landed in the NC output,\nand because its shipped-post count asserted 20 while the branch now ships\n21. This adds the mach3 onComment override, in the form the other posts\nuse, and sets the count to 21.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
