  {
    "sha": "d84792b1562dd7952b25982eb88e0ff27e0fec2d",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOVyylVtoAKGQ4NDc5MmIxNTYyZGQ3OTUyYjI1OTgyZWI4OGUwZmYyN2UwZmVjMmQ",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-22T17:20:39Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-22T17:20:39Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): list Mach3 with the mill posts, before Heidenhain Klartext\n\nThe merge of main put the Klartext entry from main between Mach4 and\nMach3 in BUILTINS. The conformance test lists the mill posts of\nPOSTS first and Klartext after them, so every_builtin_registry_entry_compiles\nand every_builtin_declares_its_controls_file_extension failed. Mach3\nis a mill post of POSTS: it now comes before Klartext in BUILTINS and\nin EXTENSIONS. The names are the persistence contract; the order is\nonly the picker order.\n\nRefs #2482\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
